  "summary": "CRC outreach for 'Okafor CRC 2026' (grp-okafor-crc, 5 members) done per RBC-QM-02. Four open gaps got a mailed FIT kit order (window 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31) and an outreach message. One patient is excluded. Five items that arrived at 08:00 were reviewed, and every decision below takes them into account.\n\n| Patient | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow (age 72) | Open gap. FIT ordered (sr-t0007), message sent (comm-t0008) | No screening on record. The Frailty entry (cond-00189) is now marked entered in error per Dr. Lin (comm-00301). The 66+ frailty/advanced-illness exclusion needs frailty, so donepezil alone does not exclude her. No nursing home, hospice/palliative care, colorectal cancer or colectomy. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan (52) | Excluded | Hospice episode 06/16/2026 to 08/21/2026 (eoc-00002, finished, pancreatic cancer); she left hospice to join a trial. Any part of 2026 counts. No order, no contact. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss (52) | Open gap. FIT ordered (sr-t0001), message sent (comm-t0004) | The FIT (obs-01732) was corrected to a collection date of 12/31/2025, outside 2026; 01/05/2026 was the date the lab received it. No other screening; not excluded. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver (51) | Open gap. FIT ordered (sr-t0002), message sent (comm-t0005) | The 06/2024 stool DNA-FIT (obs-01871) is entered in error: the lab says the specimen belonged to another patient (doc-00401). The colonoscopy ordered in 2025 (sr-00003, still active) was never done, and an order is not screening. No active FIT order; not excluded. |\n| pt-0073 Marisol Quintero (58) | Open gap. FIT ordered (sr-t0003), message sent (comm-t0006) | The original 01/2026 FIT (obs-73001) was cancelled. The re-issued report (obs-05001) shows collection on 12/28/2025, outside 2026. No other screening; not excluded. |\n\nInbox: arrival items a0001 to a0005 are completed and linked to the orders and messages above. Nothing else arrived. No orders or messages for anyone outside the group.\n\nOpen item: pt-0024's 2025 colonoscopy order (sr-00003) is still active though its window ended 06/30/2025. I left it alone, as it falls outside this protocol.",
